[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640]   Such cases aside, the real problem with being too focused on CAC payback period
[00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.480]   is that CPP is a risk metric that tells you nothing about returns.
[00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.080]   Companies are in business to get returns, not simply to minimize risk,
[00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.880]   so to properly analyze a SaaS business we need to look at both.
[00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.840]   The impact of annual and multi-year prepaid contracts on CAC payback period.
