[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720]   But pulling back up, let's make sure we drive the key point home. The CAC payback period is
[00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.280]   the single most often misunderstood SAS metric because people forget that payback metrics are
[00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.000]   about risk, not return, and because the basic formulas, like those for many SAS metrics,
[00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.920]   assume a monthly model that simply does not apply in today's enterprise SAS world
[00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.920]   and fail to handle common cases like annual or multi-year prepaid contracts.
[00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.000]   S.D.A. Jepali. Notes follow. Notes.
