[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400]   One time, back in the day at Business Objects, we were all flying back from Paris to San
[00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.600]   Francisco when the plane pulled ten feet back from the gate and then stopped.
[00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.680]   The pilot announced that we were taking a delay of several hours.
[00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:16.600]   Frustrated, one of our board members, a very polished, powerful, statuesque man, immediately
[00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.160]   asked the flight attendant if he could get off the plane.
[00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.940]   He wanted to take another flight and felt unfairly trapped.
[00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:22.940]   She said no.
[00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.800]   A polite dispute ensued.
[00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.560]   As we, the management team, watched in awe of his calm, yet firm, argumentative style,
[00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.940]   a strange thing happened.
