[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520]   "I don't want to talk to you anymore," he said. "I want to speak to the pilot."
[00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.120]   "But, but, but, what do you mean you need to talk to me, because, uh, uh, uh, uh,
[00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.360]   I don't want to talk to you anymore," he repeated. For years, many of us on the executive team would
[00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.840]   joke about how one day our terminations might go down. But you don't understand, the seminar
[00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.040]   attendance was low because there was a blizzard that closed the roads and shut down public
[00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.880]   transportation. All I know is we failed to achieve our lead generation goal.
[00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.760]   But it was a freak April snowstorm.
