[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160]   And then a huge gut check went off.
[00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.160]   Wait a minute.
[00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.200]   What does it mean when I don't want to talk to the person who runs at my company is an
[00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.680]   important part of the company.
[00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.880]   I run the company.
[00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.120]   I am hugely committed to the company's success which cannot happen without success in.
[00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.120]   How can this be?
[00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:17.640]   In business, we are generally taught to be logical and data-driven, which lines up very
[00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.440]   well with my natural style.
[00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.440]   But this was emotional.
[00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.440]   This was a feeling.
[00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.800]   I didn't want to talk with someone.
[00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800]   What did it mean?
[00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.440]   Should I listen to the feeling or ignore it?
[00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.920]   I didn't want to talk with someone.
[00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:27.920]   What did it mean?
[00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.240]   Listen to the feeling or ignore it.
