[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840]   People who don't listen. There's no point in talking to someone who doesn't listen.
[00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.040]   It gets boring over time. People who don't follow through.
[00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:11.600]   What good is agreeing to a plan and then have it not get executed? People who can't keep up.
[00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.040]   When someone is over their head in a job, they can't keep up with the conversation.
[00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.400]   Who wants to talk to someone when you have to keep backing up and slowing down?
[00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.400]   People who griff, KU. Who wants to talk to people who nod their head in agreement when
[00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.440]   you know they disagree? People who can't or won't change.
[00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.760]   How many times do you want to have the same converse?
