[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560]   As always, I'll remind you of some disclaimers. Don't view this as investment advice or anything
[00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.360]   resembling it. Be while I generally avoid politics on my blog. I make an exception in these posts
[00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.360]   because I like to start macro and then zoom in. See, remember that I do this for fun and
[00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.680]   entertainment so please take it as such. And my self-scoring for the previous year is always
[00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:24.480]   generous. This is my 12th annual predictions post. Let's begin. Review of 2025 predictions.
