[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680]   1. America gets what we deserve. Hit. I predicted a more brazen, more interest-conflicted and
[00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:10.080]   less-constrained Trump and scored a hat-trick. The more interesting question today, given
[00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.460]   that Trump has increasingly diverged from his official platform, if less so from his
[00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:17.200]   unofficial one, is whether people are getting what they think they voted for and if they
[00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.360]   are happy with the results. Some visible MAGA types from MTG to the QAnon Shaman are saying
[00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:26.940]   no. Either way, we voted for Trump and we got him. I believe that will one day serve
[00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.660]   an enduring reminder that character matters and leaders say.
