[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.560]   2. The Brolaguerks enjoy their 15 minutes of fame.
[00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.800]   Hit. I almost scored this a miss because some of the tech bros have enjoyed more than their
[00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.020]   15 minutes, but I'll credit myself with the hit because Elon Musk was the poster child
[00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:16.080]   for this group and, with the dog fiasco, he exemplified what I was predicting.
