[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640]   Many Silicon Valley leaders appear to have aligned themselves around four priorities
[00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:10.560]   (a) a more favorable exit environment, including a revival of Big Tech M&A after an FTC posture
[00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:16.320]   that had largely stymied it, (b) crypto, which, despite substantial effort to convince myself
[00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:23.200]   otherwise, I continue to view as suspect BECA, a light-touch regulatory framework for AI and
[00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.800]   depro-growth energy policy, given AI's heavy dependence on power. I foresaw much of this
[00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.340]   thanks to this December 2023 quote from Ben Horowitz.
