[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840]   We are non-partisan, one-issue voters.
[00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:07.480]   If a candidate supports an optimistic technology-enabled future, we are for them.
[00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:11.160]   If they want to choke off important technologies, we are against them.
[00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.840]   Thus far, the administration has largely delivered, so the dejarity may well feel vindicated,
[00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.840]   though I could do without the sane washing.
[00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.040]   In the coming year, we will learn more about precisely what they traded in this Faustian bargain.
