[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200]   4) Attention is the new oil. Hit.
[00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.000]   This one is an accidental double entendre because of the popularization of LLMs enabled
[00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.160]   by the transformer architecture published in the famous 2017 paper Attention is All
[00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.280]   You Need. But my intent here was not to talk about transformers but communications, inspired
[00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.280]   by Chris Hayes' book, The Siren's Call.
