[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920]   The point of this prediction was to say that we're leaving the age of information and entering the
[00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:09.680]   age of attention—information used to be scarce. That drove content marketing strategies and the
[00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.360]   use of gated assets to drive leads. But a few things changed.
