[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240]   The algorithms have taken over social media to the point where the word "follow" is meaningless.
[00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.080]   It's no longer enough to have a large follower count, you need to write posts that the algorithm
[00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.200]   likes or no one will see them. Thanks to AI, content generation has become free. Whereas
[00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.680]   information was once scarce, information is now plentiful and cheap. Unfortunately,
[00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.800]   it's often AI slop. Thus, the challenge is no longer producing and optimizing gated assets,
[00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.680]   but instead trying to break through the noise with your point of view,
[00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.960]   all while the gatekeepers are changing from search engines to Genoir.
