[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400]   As AI changes how people browse, it is altering the economic bargain at the heart of the internet.
[00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.600]   Human traffic has long been monetized using online advertising now that traffic is drying
[00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.880]   up. Content producers are urgently trying to find new ways to make AI companies pay
[00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.760]   them for information. If they cannot, the open web may evolve into something very different.
[00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:23.800]   There's no better example of the effects of AI front-running on web traffic than Stack
[00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.360]   Overflow, chart posted by a top 10, all-time contributor as you can read about in this post by Gergali Arras.
