[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880]   6. Working for the algo. Hit.
[00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.120]   This was a contrarian prediction inspired by an odd fact.
[00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.560]   The Turing test asked whether a computer could convince a human that it was human.
[00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.320]   Today we're living through the inverse.
[00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:15.840]   Humans increasingly have to convince computers that we are human.
[00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.480]   If that sounds strange, think about kapaches.
[00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.360]   Every time you solve one, that's exactly what you're doing.
