[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200]   7. The Death of SAS is Greatly Exaggerated. Partial. This prediction was playing off
[00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.360]   two things. a) A popular rant by Satya Nadella about how Satya Nadella atop a CRUB database
[00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:15.080]   and b) the widely distributed September 2024 story of Korna's plans to replace Salesforce
[00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.880]   with in-house AI applications. Since then, the storm around the Satya rant quieted quickly
[00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.240]   and the Korna Satya O went on record saying he was terribly embarrassed about the whole
[00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:23.940]   situation.
