[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240]   It doesn't start with ripping out Salesforce or Workday. It starts with a huge variety of
[00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:09.680]   new applications focused either functionally, for example VIC.A and accounts payable, or vertically,
[00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.520]   for example, even up in personal injury law, continues into enterprise.
[00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:19.920]   AI application platforms such as Writer & Glean and a new generation of low-code/no-code tools
[00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:24.880]   for building bespoke applications from the red-hot vibe coding companies, for example Lovable,
[00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:30.720]   reblet to new offerings from established enterprise vendors, like OutsideM's Slang Cremony Incery.
