[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800]   The idea is simple, as traditional demand gen and performance marketing channels become more
[00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.920]   expensive and less effective. Marketers increasingly want to allocate budget to more brand-oriented
[00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:15.200]   programs. I think this is a good idea because AA brand and demand spend feed each other.
[00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.480]   You're more likely to register for a webinar from a company that you know,
[00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:24.000]   and e. Over the past five years, we, as an industry, have over-rotated to highly measurable
[00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.960]   marketing into a myopic position where boards and CEOs are now reluctant to invest,
[00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.920]   unless you can show me the money quickly and directly. But E-A-H-E.
