[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840]   That's not how marketing works, it's not how people work, and while measuring brand
[00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.920]   program effectiveness requires stepping outside the world of traditional CRN reporting,
[00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.400]   it is by no means impossible. That said, brand measurement is something of a lost
[00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.960]   art that marketers will need to re-zarn in 2026. For listeners of The Metrics Brothers,
[00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.840]   Ray and I are scheduling an episode on this topic for early in the year.
