[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400]   1. Trump, but even more so. With checks and balances significantly weakened, expect an
[00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.680]   even less-constrained Trump presidency. His leadership and communication style, modeled
[00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:15.120]   more off a 1970s mafia don than a democratic statesman, will likely become even more pronounced.
[00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.520]   That means more indecency, corruption, lip service to the rule of law, revisionism, power
[00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.840]   plays, and Don Roe.
[00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:26.200]   Doctrine foreign policy. Given his age and health, Trump may view 2026 as a culminating
[00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.960]   chapter, raising the odds of bolder, riskier moves aimed at both leaving his mark and
[00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:30.920]   cementing his legacy.
