[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.640]   Speaking of legacy, prediction market Kalshi currently assigns a 16% chance that Trump leaves office in 2026.
[00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:13.840]   Thus, the possibility of a vast presidency is becoming more plausible, if not in 2026 than perhaps in 2027.
[00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.600]   Maybe, among other things, we'll learn to stop electing Septogenarians.
[00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.360]   Meantime, if you're interested in learning how people can perceive reality so differently,
[00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:26.720]   try reading Good Reasonable People by Keith Payne. It's insightful, if not particularly optimistic.
