[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840]   I second that emotion.
[00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.640]   2. It's a bubble, but this time it's different.
[00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.720]   Make no mistake, today's AI market has many of the hallmarks of a classic bubble,
[00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:13.520]   for example, technology catalyst, euphoria, high valuations, debt accumulation.
[00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.200]   And, of course, part of the euphoria is everyone saying it isn't a bubble.
[00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.960]   That is, this time is different.
