[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320]   But I think there are some key differences between today's situation and the internet bubble that
[00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:09.600]   will affect how this one unwinds. Usually bubbles pop. I think this one is going to leak. That is,
[00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:15.120]   the deflation will run in slow motion relative to traditional bubbles. Why? Three things.
[00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.840]   (a) d) This is a private market bubble where most of the players are not public companies.
[00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:25.360]   (b) Everything happens in slow motion in VC/PE land where funds last a decade and trading,
[00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.800]   that is, valuation determination, is infrequent, and (t) that is valuation determination.
[00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.400]   Is infrequent, and (t) DA sure is opacity in the private markets that can make it hard or imp.
