[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320]   This can't happen when companies are public.
[00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.600]   Thus, I believe that private bubbles end differently than public ones.
[00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.680]   They deflate, as opposed to pop.
[00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.720]   The process happens more slowly and with less hysteria.
[00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:11.920]   But it happens.
[00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.920]   Some will argue it's already happened to the last generation of SAS unicorns.
[00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:21.120]   In 2026, it will start to happen to many of the AI ones, including a few of the big ones.
