[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960]   The same is true of switchboard operators, pin setters, lamp lighters, linotype setters,
[00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.720]   icemen, typists, shorthand secretaries, and celebrity offers.
[00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.120]   Yet all these jobs were automated away.
[00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.320]   While I'm sure transition was rough for any given elevator operator,
[00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.320]   as a society we don't miss them.
[00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.680]   Most coal miners work hard so their children won't have to be coal miners.
