[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720]   Let's remember where the word "Luddite" comes from.
[00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:06.880]   Today, we use the word to describe people opposed to new technology.
[00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:08.960]   But the Luddites were part of a labor movement.
[00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.600]   They didn't destroy machines because they were technophobes.
[00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.680]   They destroyed them to protect jobs.
[00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:18.560]   So, the transitions can be rough and come with social unrest, when jobs are automated away.
[00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.720]   But we still don't miss the jobs they fought for.
