[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540]   This is an example of AI driving a job up, not out.
[00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.120]   But this doesn't always happen either.
[00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:08.720]   I watched Jensen Huang trying to apply this exact argument to Uber drivers.
[00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.220]   Let's just say that it didn't work.
[00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.380]   For some jobs, such as drivers, they just drive.
[00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.120]   Those jobs are more driven out than up.
