[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880]   So, are we all condemned to become unthinking LLM-ings?
[00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.760]   I'm not as negative as the "we won't be missed" crowd-thoughtful rebuttal here.
[00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.280]   Nor do I believe that the path to AGI is through LLMs.
[00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:14.920]   But, with admittedly little background in this space, I am nevertheless drawn to the
[00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:19.720]   idea of world models, which act as state prediction machines as opposed to word prediction machines.
