[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.320]   In short, AI will displace a lot of jobs, but many will be pushed up, not out.
[00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:10.080]   While the transition costs will be painful for those affected, society overall will benefit.
[00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.980]   In the end, a lot of bygone jobs won't be missed.
[00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:16.160]   And I'm quite optimistic about our ability to make interesting new ones.
