[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000]   5. The polymaths aren't polymathing. Since money isn't the flex it used to be in Silicon
[00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.520]   Valley, something was bound to replace it. Now you can't just be well educated, you
[00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.300]   can't just be rich, you can't just be smart about technology. You need something more,
[00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.020]   you need to be smart about everything. That is, you need to be a polymath.
