[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840]   So, the first part of this prediction is simple.
[00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:07.620]   I think being a polymath will be the ultimate flex in Silicon Valley in 2026, and thus we'll
[00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:12.000]   see an increasing number of people working to attain, and demonstrating the flex of polymath
[00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000]   status.
[00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.840]   If you want to join the wave, start by reading these lists of books recommended by Marc Andreessen.
[00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.240]   There's some great stuff in there.
