[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700]   What's less cool is when Silicon Valley leaders decide that they are smarter than everybody about everything.
[00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:10.320]   Sure, in the spirit of the bear joke, you might be smarter about history than the other MIT engineer.
[00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.840]   But are you smarter than the person whose lifelong passion is history?
[00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.920]   Do you know more about international relations than the person who went to SACE and then to the State Department?
[00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:23.920]   Do you know more about improving government efficiency than people who've spent their entire careers working in government?
