[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760]   Moreover, were the people who built the data structure behind tweets the best people to predict
[00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:08.560]   the societal impact of Twitter? Are the people who build GPUs or foundation models really the
[00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:13.360]   best people to predict the societal impact of AI? We tend to confuse the ability to build something
[00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:18.080]   with being in the best position to understand its impact. Oppenheimer knew how to build the bomb,
[00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.880]   but later said, quoting the Bhagavad Gita, "Now I am become death, the destroyer of worlds."
[00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.080]   If you want to know how to build a bomb, ask a physicist.
