[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320]   Finally, there's a difference between being well-rounded and being a dilettante.
[00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:08.480]   When the new Silicon Valley overlords, whose primary competency is making money by creating
[00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:12.720]   technology businesses, start thinking they should be in charge of government and society,
[00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:17.620]   blind to their own ambitions and agendas, we're going to get more messes, for example, dog,
[00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.400]   more inane statements, and more crazy interviews.
[00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.980]   The reputation of Silicon Valley will continue to suffer, and eventually, probably in 2027
[00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:29.840]   or 2028, we'll see backlash-driven policies that actually hurt the ecosystem.
[00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.960]   as bizarre as the thigh.
