[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920]   If they were really dialed in, the new overlords would take a lesson from the robber barons,
[00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:08.080]   such as Andrew Carnegie, and build libraries and write essays like The Gospel of Wealth.
[00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.720]   They'd also take fewer dubious actions and obviously self-interested policy positions.
[00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:18.960]   6. Trust is the antidote. Across a web of AI-generated algorithm-juiced content,
[00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:23.280]   people don't know who they can trust anymore. What news can they trust? What companies can they
[00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:23.780]   they believe.
