[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000]   Can they trust the answers to seemingly basic questions like how much does this hotel cost?
[00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.800]   Ah, the mandatory resort fee.
[00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.700]   Or how much does this ticket cost?
[00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.300]   Ah, convenience fees or seat reservation fees.
[00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.400]   And with generative AI, can they even trust what they see with their own eyes?
[00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.600]   Was that video real? How about this photo?
