[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120]   You know when people don't have time for your content? When it's bad.
[00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.720]   And there's so much bad content out there that we started to believe that lazy people were the
[00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:12.320]   problem. No they aren't. Bad content is the problem. And now it's easier than ever to generate it.
[00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.560]   So do we win the war by out-slopping our competition? Or do we try something else?
