[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660]   So, overall, what would I do?
[00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:03.920]   Make good content.
[00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.080]   Make long content.
[00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.780]   Get rid of artificial and outdated best practices and constraints.
[00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.180]   Take the time to tell the story you need to tell.
[00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.240]   Build your own, first-party audience.
[00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:18.280]   Get access to and respect the roles of, private communities for example, the SaaS CFO Exit
[00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.820]   5 that are increasingly forming to provide trusted spaces.
[00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.580]   And don't be afraid to place marketing chips on brand over demand in 2026.
