[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.060]   7. Fee Culture Changes VC As with several of my predictions, this one
[00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:11.260]   is already in progress, but I do see it accelerating in 2026. The trend in VC is towards increasingly
[00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:16.380]   larger funds, for example, A16Z's recent announcement of over $15 billion across about
[00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:23.700]   six funds, representing 18% of all VC dollars raised in the USA in 2025. Read The Metamorphosis
[00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:27.360]   of A-160s for a fascinating, if somewhat conspiratorial, take.
