[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840]   Remember being shocked, and this is going to sound incredibly stupid, when I heard someone
[00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:09.200]   refer to VC as part of financial services. What? VCs aren't Wall Street types, I thought.
[00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.520]   They're tech people. Of course, I was wrong at the time, but part of me nevertheless continues
[00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:18.880]   to see this as the financialization of VC, or more aptly perhaps, the PEization of VC.
[00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.840]   8. A Growth Retention Apocalypse. I'll start this one with an excerpt from The Grapes of Wrath.
