[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160]   Then the grapes ripen. We can't make good wine. People can't buy good wine.
[00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.080]   Rip the grapes from the vines, good grapes, rotten grapes, lost-stung grapes,
[00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.480]   pressed stems, pressed dirt, and rot. But there's mildew and formic acid in the vats.
[00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:16.640]   Add sulfur and tannic acid. The smell from the ferment is not the rich odor of wine,
[00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.560]   but the smell of decay and chemicals.
