[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200]   That's the way I feel about ARR today. Press trials. Press onboarding. Press professional
[00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:11.200]   services. Press overages and hardware. Take anything, multiply it by 12, and then press that.
[00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.520]   The smell from the ferment is not the oh-so-sweet smell of annual recurring revenue,
[00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.280]   but that of Vigon customers, tire kickers, experiments, and decay.
[00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.280]   In other words, I see what Cassie Young calls a growth retention apocalypse.
[00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.480]   I think we should measure it with a metric that I call retention spread.
