[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880]   The first post I saw was this paper by Jaya Gupta and Ashu Garg of Foundation Capital.
[00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.520]   I've rarely seen any enterprise idea hit harder, take off faster, and get more engagement.
[00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.800]   Over the next few days, here are some of the folks who joined the conversation.
[00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:18.320]   Dharmesh Shah, HubSpot, Aaron Levy-Box, Nick Metta, GameSight Emeritus, Arvind Jain-Glean,
[00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:23.520]   Satyan Sangani, Alation, Anshu Sharma, Skyflow, Colin Tressler, Supernormal,
[00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.640]   Radiant, Anamesh Kauratana, Player Zero Diego, Lamonta Writer, CMO, who made a
[00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:33.240]   a particularly compelling case for marketing, Kirkmarple Grafflett, Anchil Gupta Active.
