[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960]   Ultimately, what's exciting is that this is much more than just replacing existing
[00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.760]   systems or building value-added layers atop them.
[00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:12.240]   It's about capturing a category of information, knowledge, and enterprise systems that has,
[00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.760]   for the past five decades, generally eluded us in all but the most specialized systems.
[00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.760]   That's big.
[00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.160]   In the 1980s, I got to watch the industry transform by capturing data.
