[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.080]   And most do. Hence, why I predict, particularly in the traditional SaaS, non-native, AI part of
[00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.960]   the market, that most companies will be shooting for Rule of 40 scores of between 40 and 60 in
[00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:17.840]   2026. The Rule of 40 is dead, long live the Rule of 60, that is, unless you're a native AI startup
[00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.880]   and growing like a weed. Conclusion.
