[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160]   If you've read all the way through, let me offer a special thank you for sticking with me.
[00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:09.200]   I wish everyone a happy, healthy, and above planned 2026. I'll conclude with a hat tip
[00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.760]   to Bob Weir of the Grateful Dead who died 12 days ago. Here's John Mayer playing a touching ripple
[00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.800]   on one of Bobby's guitars at his life celebration in San Francisco last weekend. Notes follow.
[00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.280]   Notes also see terms and conditions as well as other disclaimers in the Kell blog FAQ.
