[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000]   At the time, I remember thinking two things, a "how unusual" and, arguably, "unwise."
[00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.500]   It was for VC firm to declare a political position, and B, that as soon as you declare yourself a single-issue voter on any issue,
[00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.000]   you absolve yourself from looking at the bigger picture and the very real complexities within it.
[00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000]   In short, it's a cop-out.
