[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560]   On LinkedIn and X, I can write posts that reach 1% of my followers if I don't pay attention to the
[00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.680]   rules, and playing the game works differently on different platforms. LinkedIn swims upstream on
[00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:14.880]   many of its choices, so what works elsewhere will tend not to work on LinkedIn, and conversely,
[00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.600]   where I sit on the board, where Balderton is an investor, with whom I also do some work.
[00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.680]   As of the day I wrote this January 14, 2026, that includes only resignation or removal.
[00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:30.560]   Prediction markets don't allow bets on deaths, so this market will not resolve to yes and not event.
