[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800]   In some cases, it's creating; in others, it's more walking in front of a parade.
[00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.900]   For example, Benioff, Musk, Altman, and many others, all to a greater or lesser degree
[00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.680]   walked in front of a parade.
[00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.920]   This of course is also a skill, both in identifying the right parade and in finding a way to get
[00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:16.920]   in front of it.
[00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.600]   And then, of course, building the business once you're there.
[00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.760]   And deciding who you want to be is a key part of the exercise.
[00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:29.840]   Assumptions, $250 million funds, 5 GPs, 2+20 fees, 4 funds in parallel, 3 million dollars
[00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.280]   staff and admin expense.
