[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400]   Due to its odd name, there are some tongue-tying semantics around it.
[00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.980]   For example, "My Rule of 40 is 30," or "We are a Rule of 30 company."
[00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.760]   To avoid this, I insert the word "score," that is, "Our Rule of 40 score is 30."
[00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.620]   I'll use "growth," "profit" as my nomenclature for communicating the elements
[00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.920]   of the Rule of 40 score.
