[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.560]   Revise May 4, 2019, 10,041 AM. After years of experience with and thinking about multi-year,
[00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.400]   prepaid SaaS deals, my mental jury is back in the box and the verdict is in.
[00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.840]   If you're a startup that is within my assumptions epilogue, don't do them.
[00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.400]   Before jumping in, let me first define precisely what I mean by multi-year, prepaid deals, and
[00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.400]   second, detail the assumptions behind my logic in response to some Twitter conversations I've
[00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.920]   had this morning about this post.
