[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620]   What do I mean by multi-year prepaid deals?
[00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:05.400]   Well, there are many forms of multi-year prepaid deals.
[00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.220]   When I use the term, I am thinking primarily of a three-year agreement that is fully prepaid.
