[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760]   By default, our annual contracts have a 10% annual increase built in. If you sign and
[00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.940]   prepay a three-year agreement, that is, pay me 300 units within 60 days, then I will lock
[00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:15.500]   you in at the 100 units per year price. Some people didn't know these kinds of deals were
[00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.940]   possible – they are. In my experience, particularly for high-consideration
[00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.940]   purchases where the customer has completed a thorough evaluation and is quite sure the
[00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:29.020]   system will work, a fairly high percentage of buyers will engage in this conversation.
[00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:32.500]   In a world where companies have a lot of cash, a 10% return is a lot.
