[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400]   Multi-year prepaid deals can take other forms as well. The duration can vary. I've seen anything
[00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.680]   from two to seven years. The contract duration and the prepaid duration can decouple, for example,
[00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.680]   a five-year deal where the first three years are prepaid. But, to make it simple,
[00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.040]   just think of a three-year fully prepaid deal as the canonical example.
