[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160]   What are my underlying assumptions? As several readers pointed out, there are some very good
[00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.960]   reasons to do multi-year prepaid deals. Most of all, they are a financial win/win for both
[00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.640]   vendor and customer. The customer earns a higher rate of return than bank interest,
[00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.280]   and the vendor gets access to capital at a modest cost.
