[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600]   Why do I recommend avoiding multi-year prepaid deals?
[00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.020]   In a phrase, it's because they're not the norm.
[00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:10.440]   If you want to raise money from, and eventually sell to, people who are used to SaaS businesses
[00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.420]   that look a certain way, unless you are specifically trying to disrupt the business model, then
[00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.040]   you should generally do things that certain way.
[00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.640]   Multi-year prepaid deals complicate numerous things and each of those complications will
[00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.320]   be seen not as endemic to the space, but as idiosyncratic to your company.
[00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:27.080]   Here's the list of reasons why you should watch out.
[00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:28.660]   prepaid deals while you should watch out.
