[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400]   are not the norm, so they raise eyebrows among investors and can backfire with customers.
[00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.040]   Complexify SaaS metrics. SaaS businesses are hard enough to understand already.
[00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.280]   Multi-year deals make metrics calculation and interpretation even more complicated.
[00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.920]   For example, do you want to argue with investors that your CAC payback period is not 18 months,
[00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:22.880]   but one day? You can, but you'll face a great risk of dying right, in so doing.
[00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.760]   And I have done so on more than one occasion. Amplify churn rates. An annual renewal rate
[00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.000]   of 90% is equivalent to a 3-year renewal rate of 72%. (B)
