[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.160]   Yes, there are a few very good reasons to do multi-year, prepaid deals, but overall
[00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.520]   I'd say most investors and acquirers would prefer if you just raised a bit more capital
[00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.800]   and didn't try to finance your growth using customer prepayments.
[00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.280]   In my experience, the Norman Enterprise software is increasingly converging to 3-year deals
[00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:21.160]   with annual payments which provide many of the advantages of multi-year deals without
[00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.200]   a lot of the added complexity.
