[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120]   Good reasons to do multi-year prepaid deals include
[00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:07.120]   Uh, they are arguably a clever form of financing using customer money
[00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.040]   Uh, they tend to buy you a second chance if a customer fails an implementation
[00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.240]   For example, if you failed nine months into a one-year contract, odds are you won't try again
[00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.200]   With a three-year prepay you might well cease
[00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.880]   They are usually a financing win/win for both vendor and customer
[00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.520]   as the discount offered exceeds the time value of money
