[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000]   In the fully decomposed organization, there is no traditional CMO.
[00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.520]   What you have instead is three distinct leaders, an SVP of demand gen, who reports to the CRO
[00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:15.400]   and is laser focused on pipeline, one or more VPs of product marketing, who report into
[00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:21.760]   the CPO ore or product GMs and own their individual products, and an SVP of corporate marketing,
[00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.480]   sometimes carrying the CMO title, sometimes not, who owns brand and communications.
