[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120]   Each product team has its own product marketer, or team leader,
[00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.240]   focused on their product's positioning, messaging, and launch.
[00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.800]   The CPO loves it because they no longer have to work.
