[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000]   The problem is that you now have three product marketers, each telling a story of their individual product.
[00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000]   Each one is perfectly capable of answering "why buy mine" for their specific product.
[00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000]   None of them is positioned, organizationally or politically, to answer a different question,
[00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000]   "why buy this product line" and "where is it going?"
[00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000]   That question falls through the org chart, and it matters enormously.
