[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.160]   Because buyers, especially enterprise buyers, don't just buy products, they buy into a vision.
[00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.840]   They're making a bet on a vendor.
[00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.040]   They want to know, does this company have a coherent strategy,
[00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.240]   or did they just bolt three products together and call it a platform?
[00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.880]   Is this a company I can grow with, or am I buying the first of many painful migrations?
