[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.240]   I've seen this gap in practice many times.
[00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.080]   In one case, a growing multi-product SaaS business with strong product marketers,
[00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:08.560]   great demand generation, and a real brand.
[00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.720]   But nobody whose job it is to walk a prospective customer through the logic of the product line,
[00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.520]   why these products together, how they reinforce each other,
[00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.920]   what the roadmap implies about where the company is going,
[00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.480]   and why that matters for a buyer making a three-year bet,
