[00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.040]   the message hangs together. They work on cross-product expansion playbooks and sales analytics.
[00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.520]   They help the company answer the questions that no individual product team can answer alone,
[00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:37.520]   [BLANK_AUDIO]
