[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000]   Product-claim marketing is the discipline of telling the story of a company's product
[00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.240]   portfolio.
[00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.480]   Why these products belong together, what the vision is for the combined offering, how a
[00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.680]   customer should think about buying one versus two versus all of them, and why the holistic
[00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.080]   roadmap is going where it's going.
[00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.280]   It lives between brand and product.
[00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.840]   It's more specific than corporate messaging and more strategic than individual product
[00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.000]   messaging.
[00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.120]   It's the connective tissue that most multi-product companies are missing.
