[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440]   Analyst relations. Because product-to-analyst mapping is rarely one-to-one, and because analysts
[00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:10.640]   themselves want to understand the integrated story, analyst and influencer relations should
[00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.440]   be in the product line marketing team. This also enables you to hire a top-class analyst
[00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:20.400]   relations leader and leverage them across products. It also centralizes basic but important
[00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:25.920]   things like contract negotiation, inquiry management, briefing and strategy day scheduling,
[00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.840]   and the general responsibility for squeezing every last drop of value out of the money you've
[00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.360]   you've invested.
[00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.380]   Too many vendors write the big check.
