[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960]   Why Battery is Long Software Overall The four eras of software evolution
[00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.360]   The five forces driving software is accelerating growth
[00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:14.800]   Key trends in 2018, including setting records in three areas, one public company revenue multiples,
[00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.360]   two IPO volume by over two times, and three M&A volume by over two times.
[00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:25.600]   Key trends from their 2018 report that are still alive, well, and driving software businesses.
[00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:29.920]   But most of all, it has some great charts on the rule of 40 that I want to present and discuss here.
[00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.720]   Before doing that, I must note that I drank today's morning coffee reading Alex Clayton's.
