[00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:54.000]   data available on the Rule of 40 scores of today's giants when they were at early, or mid-stage
[00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.320]   scale. That's why I think early, and mid-stage startups need to think about the Rule of 40 in
