[00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:15.520]   flow FCF margin. When FCF margin is not available, I typically use operating margin. Using GAAP
[00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:21.040]   operating margin here would result in L and 10% percent 55% much lower but still in Rule of 40
[00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:28.880]   compliance. If calculated using subscription revenue growth, it's 137% plus 26% EN11%, even
