[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640]   It's important to understand that such rules are not black and white. As we'll see in a minute,
[00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.560]   lots of companies deviate from the rule of 40. The right way to think about these rules
[00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:13.760]   of thumb is as predictors. Back in the day, what best predicted the value of a SaaS company?
[00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:19.280]   Revenue growth, without regard for margin, in fact often inversely correlated to margin.
[00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.680]   When that started to break down, people started looking for a better independent variable.
[00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.160]   The answer to that search was the rule of 40 score.
