[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560]   While the Rule of 40 concept preceded the SaaS acre, I do believe that the SaaS acre
[00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.840]   was the wake-up call that made more investors and companies pay attention to.
[00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.360]   Using operating margin here somewhat lazily, as I don't want to go find unlevered free
[00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.560]   cash flow margin, but I don't think it materially changes the point.
[00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.280]   Other good Rule of 40 posts are available from Tomasz Tungasz, Sandi Pichu, and Jeff
[00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.520]   Epstein and Josh Harder.
